# The Coldhold Vault hazard test (11-05): cold vents (1/s, r 13) shown by the timed terminal run. CIPlay coldhold_vault_hurt, in a test world 'CI ...', CIGapsSuit off (no suit: the zone must hurt).
island The Coldhold Vault keep
offset 0 22
hour 11
weather Calm
code term1 3317
wait 4
expect shown coldrun
at 3 10
wait 10
expect message The vents blow freezing air
# (4 is about half of the expected damage)
expect hurt 4
